WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.450
Step 3 reads the records' index.

2
00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:06.400
Result is the files' integrity,
and every record passes.

3
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.588
Check result is what the
run found, and most fail.

4
00:00:09.588 --> 00:00:15.938
Step 4 checks the chain: every file matches
its hash, ten records, chain unbroken.

5
00:00:15.938 --> 00:00:21.522
Step 5 runs the production stage's go or
no-go, and it fails, saying why for each

6
00:00:21.522 --> 00:00:27.376
step: no pre-flight record, runs whose own
checks failed, and no scheduled run yet.

7
00:00:27.376 --> 00:00:29.975
Only signals and the metrics pass.

8
00:00:29.975 --> 00:00:34.370
The command exits with an error, which
is what a go or no-go should see.
